/Title (A beloved staple of the Victoria dining scene since 1999, the Old Spaghetti Factory is just a two-minute walk from the Victoria Conference Center. Part of a proudly 100% Canadian-owned chain dating back to 1970, the Victoria location carries on the tradition of generous, all-inclusive pasta dinners served in a festive atmosphere filled with stained glass, vintage decor, and antique fixtures. Whether you are drawn to the classic browned butter and Mizithra spaghetti or something more adventurous, this is comfort food done with care.)
