/Title (Shellfish devotees, rejoice! Shuck Taylor's is Victoria's most dedicated oyster bar. The setting is intimate and unpretentious, with a small oyster bar perfect for watching the shucking action up close. The menu keeps things focused: a rotating selection of Pacific and Atlantic oysters, a Dungeness crab boil for two, Nova Scotia lobster rolls, caviar bumps, and housemade oyster-shell-infused spirits. Their motto says it all: We dive, you dine.)
